f Information Technology Pune</a> in Electronics and Communication Engineering (2017-2021) with 85.2% aggregate.</p>\n<p>Here are my skills:</p>"}}]},"jobs":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Senior Member of Technical Staff","company":"Adobe","location":null,"range":"July 2022 - Present","url":"https://www.adobe.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Led development of Agentic AI Assistant for Illustrator, integrating LLMs, MCP tools, AvA Harness and UXP components using FastAPI, to orchestrate multi-step complex canvas workflows.</li>\n<li>Designed and deployed MCP server to automate component version updates across 100+ components integrating Codex, Artifactory, Git, and Slack, reducing manual effort by 25%.</li>\n<li>Worked on an ML-based color recommendation model using feature engineering, hyperparameter tuning, improving Precision@5 by 15% and increasing color palette adoption by 9%.</li>\n<li>Implemented LangChain-based RAG pipeline for Illustrator Copilot to answer how-to questions from retrieved product documentation to reduce hallucinations and improve answer accuracy.</li>\n<li>Filed Colorization Patent using multi-feature clustering pipeline to automatically colorize complex mandala patterns.</li>\n<li>Built Hang Regression Tool from scratch, detecting new hangs, regression breaks, and crashing modules across Win/Mac Intel/ARM platforms, directly improving stability metrics to 4.5% from 6%.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Associate Software Developer","company":"Boeing","location":null,"range":"October 2021 - July 2022","url":"https://www.boeing.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Migrated 10+ on-prem applications to Azure Pipelines, reducing deployment effort and improving operational reliability.</li>\n<li>Refactored HPUX scripts to Linux and redesigned architecture to run applications on different OS configurations.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Open Source Contributor","company":"GirlScript Foundation","location":"Remote","range":"Feb 2021 - Present","url":"https://gssoc.girlscript.tech/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Selected as an Open Source Enthusiast in GirlScript Summer of Code, contributed to different projects under guidance of experienced mentors.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Engineering Intern","company":"Novopay","location":null,"range":"November 2020 - Present","url":"https://www.novopay.in/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Worked to build Credit Rating Engine from the scratch for the customers who have taken loan</li>\n<li>Revived a AI/ML Workbench that has been closed 3 years back</li>\n<li>Supported the data team for crunching and analysis purpose</li>\n<li>Added various UI/UX features in Oxygen4India website</li>\n<li>Worked on Invoices OCR Detection Model.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Web Developer Intern","company":"Pradivya Software Private Limited","location":null,"range":"August 2020 - October 2020 ","url":"http://www.workerunionsupport.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Created UI/UX for grey and white collar workers to access GIS information.</li>\n<li>Added Server application to process the images from Bhuvan for Garbage Management, Road crack/problem, and Broken water pipeline.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QKyJbp7qj5ffgBLKWH-VvfJWWeyc0edy/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">letter</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Runner-Up","company":"IBM Hack","location":null,"range":"May 2020 - July 2020","url":"https://smartinternz.com/ibm-hack-challenge-2020"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Designed a twitter sentiment analysis model to understand the people’s sentiment towards the epidemic and on the government decision to extend the lockdown.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1doiZh2yVgevKgj0CVfyOE31kLFaGe3fY/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Certificate</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Development Intern"